    "text": "Elen of the Hosts is a Welsh heroine or goddess whose name may mean sprite. In the Dream of Maxen, the conquering hero marries her, fortifies Wales with her brothers, and returns to Rome. Another, or the same, Elen built the magical roads along which her armies moved, and for that she is called of the Hosts. Her story became tangled with that of the mother of Constantine and with the daughter known from the old king. She is sometimes called the wife of the magician Merlin.",
